  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] Background automation
  [38;5;246mImports, integrations, or recurring rules mutate tasks without a person acting. Needs a server-side job runner.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] Same user, other place
  [38;5;246mOne person, several devices or tabs — a change on the phone should surface on the laptop. Needs sync, not necessarily
